WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.700
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.700 --> 00:08.270
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.270 --> 00:16.180
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.350 --> 00:27.990
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.990 --> 00:33.900
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.900 --> 00:42.840
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.840 --> 00:47.540
Kaze no you ni

00:47.540 --> 00:50.650
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.650 --> 00:54.150
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.150 --> 01:00.690
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.690 --> 01:07.430
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.430 --> 01:13.570
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.570 --> 01:20.240
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.240 --> 01:27.550
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:34.060 --> 01:37.720
Such wayward behavior is a problem.

01:41.760 --> 01:47.870
I did not give you the capacity for
emotions so you could do such things, L.A.

01:47.870 --> 01:50.240
I am disappointed in you.

01:50.240 --> 01:55.040
For an agent to fall for his target...

01:55.040 --> 01:57.780
Ellis...

01:57.780 --> 02:00.050
Do you love her?

02:00.050 --> 02:02.040
Ellis...

02:07.460 --> 02:09.790
Ellis...

02:09.790 --> 02:12.790
My...

02:12.790 --> 02:14.630
...Ellis.

02:20.340 --> 02:22.600
You are a troublesome child.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.780
Reeducation, is it?

02:34.780 --> 02:37.620
It came sooner than expected, but...

02:37.620 --> 02:40.290
Well, that's fine.

02:40.290 --> 02:44.250
A blue sky does not suit Rosenberg.

03:03.340 --> 03:05.010
Lirio.

03:08.280 --> 03:10.380
What was that, you bastard?!

03:15.390 --> 03:17.520
They've got too much time on their hands...

03:27.070 --> 03:29.370
What an unpleasant town.

03:34.140 --> 03:35.580
You like that?

03:35.580 --> 03:39.080
The incandescent flames of love blazed...

03:39.080 --> 03:41.750
You don't have to get all ablaze
over something like that.

03:41.750 --> 03:43.180
There. Thanks for your patience.

03:43.180 --> 03:45.350
Oh, thank you.

03:46.720 --> 03:48.710
He's still there.

03:57.200 --> 03:59.170
Señor Sanchez...

03:59.170 --> 04:02.840
Hello. I didn't see you come in...

04:02.840 --> 04:06.370
That makes sense. No wonder he ran.

04:06.370 --> 04:09.080
You're not startled?

04:09.080 --> 04:11.210
Would you rather I was startled?

04:11.210 --> 04:13.180
It would've been cuter.

04:13.180 --> 04:15.450
Eek.

04:15.450 --> 04:16.920
Hey, now.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.680
Am I cute?

04:20.920 --> 04:23.120
Eek.

04:23.120 --> 04:26.620
Cut it out. You don't know what
you're getting yourself into.

04:30.870 --> 04:33.940
I'll take this.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.240
I don't need the change.

04:35.240 --> 04:37.300
Oh, thank you...

04:40.880 --> 04:42.940
You shouldn't accept gifts from strangers.

04:42.940 --> 04:45.080
It's fine. Keep it.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.650
We don't want it.

04:46.650 --> 04:48.550
It's a souvenir.

04:48.550 --> 04:51.320
Souvenir?

04:51.320 --> 04:54.420
Take that and get on out of here.

04:54.420 --> 04:57.390
I don't appreciate being spoken to that way.

04:57.390 --> 04:59.290
You're honest.

05:01.000 --> 05:03.160
I was raised well.

05:08.640 --> 05:10.740
A bounty hunter, huh?

05:10.740 --> 05:13.840
Are you here in pursuit of someone?

05:13.840 --> 05:15.580
No...

05:15.580 --> 05:17.780
I caught a big bounty the other day,

05:17.780 --> 05:19.780
so my little sister and I
are on a trip to celebrate.

05:19.780 --> 05:22.450
Right, Ellis?

05:22.450 --> 05:26.990
I see. Then all the more
reason to leave town quickly.

05:26.990 --> 05:29.860
You'll be a target if you have deep pockets.

05:34.100 --> 05:36.260
So she's your little sister.

05:36.260 --> 05:38.030
You don't look alike at all.

05:38.030 --> 05:40.500
She's wrong. I'm not her little sister.

05:40.500 --> 05:42.500
What? But she just said...

05:42.500 --> 05:45.170
Oh, what I just said was... well...

05:45.170 --> 05:47.880
- It's wrong to lie, you know.
- Huh?

05:47.880 --> 05:51.810
The Doctor said that it's bad to lie.

05:51.810 --> 05:54.520
But I had no choice in this case.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.120
No lies.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.850
Yeah, yeah.

05:57.850 --> 05:59.820
Hey, what's going on with that thing?

05:59.820 --> 06:01.190
Actually, the thing is...

06:01.190 --> 06:03.020
- You still haven't done it?!
- I'm sorry.

06:03.020 --> 06:05.490
Get it done already... Oh. Crap.

06:10.130 --> 06:13.300
Say, who was that tough-looking guy?

06:13.300 --> 06:17.970
His name's Sanchez. He's the
number two of the Candela Family.

06:17.970 --> 06:19.070
Mafia, huh?

06:19.070 --> 06:21.310
Something seems to have happened in the Family,

06:21.310 --> 06:24.150
and he's been doing the
rounds rather diligently lately.

06:24.150 --> 06:25.750
Huh...

06:25.750 --> 06:27.980
What's the number two?

06:27.980 --> 06:30.180
It's the second person in charge.

06:30.180 --> 06:31.990
It's just like it sounds.

06:31.990 --> 06:35.760
There's no other way to say it.

06:35.760 --> 06:37.730
Come on, let's go.

06:37.730 --> 06:39.720
Oh, your change!

06:40.830 --> 06:42.030
We don't need the change.

06:42.030 --> 06:43.660
We do need it!

06:43.660 --> 06:45.430
You be careful now.

06:45.430 --> 06:49.000
They tend to target cute girls like you.

06:49.000 --> 06:52.010
Then, you'd better be careful, too.

06:52.010 --> 06:53.340
What?

06:53.340 --> 06:55.370
Oh, please!

07:03.750 --> 07:06.450
Ellis, hold this for a sec.

07:17.900 --> 07:19.590
Nadie?

07:29.540 --> 07:31.550
You can't do it immediately?

07:31.550 --> 07:35.150
It can't be helped, Señor.

07:35.150 --> 07:38.890
The operation room is that way, right?

07:38.890 --> 07:42.550
Oh, Señor! Please wait, Señor!

07:52.400 --> 07:54.230
Does it hurt?

07:56.970 --> 07:59.670
Want some water?

08:06.680 --> 08:08.510
Nadie...

08:25.630 --> 08:28.260
Hey, the doctor will be right in to...

08:39.450 --> 08:41.280
You...

09:20.820 --> 09:22.850
It's you, Sanchez.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.760
Pops, let me introduce you...

09:29.760 --> 09:32.700
Paulina...

09:32.700 --> 09:35.500
You came back to me...

09:35.500 --> 09:38.170
No, it's not her. This girl is...

09:38.170 --> 09:40.880
Welcome home, Paulina.

09:40.880 --> 09:44.610
You're wrong. I'm Ellis.

09:44.610 --> 09:46.710
Not Paulina.

09:48.280 --> 09:51.850
Ah, your hair is so soft.

09:51.850 --> 09:54.250
Just like it's always been.

10:04.700 --> 10:07.640
Huh. So he's on a business trip. Where to?

10:07.640 --> 10:10.440
No idea. I hear it's somewhere
outside the country, though.

10:10.440 --> 10:13.070
I guess this place has a lot of money.

10:32.390 --> 10:34.730
Was it the cake I had for dessert?

10:37.900 --> 10:39.490
Time to regroup.

10:51.750 --> 10:53.480
Sorry about that.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.950
Is that man sick?

10:55.950 --> 10:58.120
The doctors have given up on him.

10:58.120 --> 11:01.420
- He's going to die?
- I won't let him.

11:01.420 --> 11:04.260
I don't really understand
what kind of power you have,

11:04.260 --> 11:07.430
but I'm betting you can save him.

11:07.430 --> 11:10.870
Use your power to make
the old man better for me.

11:10.870 --> 11:13.770
He's your father?

11:13.770 --> 11:19.370
No, his name is Enrique
Candela. The family boss.

11:19.370 --> 11:21.480
I'm going to make him better?

11:21.480 --> 11:23.840
- Please.
- I can't do it.

11:23.840 --> 11:26.440
I'll pay you as much as you want.

11:31.220 --> 11:33.020
It's not money, then?

11:33.020 --> 11:36.890
What is it? What do you want?

11:36.890 --> 11:39.290
The dogs...

11:39.290 --> 11:40.730
Huh?

11:40.730 --> 11:42.630
They're watching.

11:45.900 --> 11:49.240
If you're mad that your
friend got shot, I apologize.

11:49.240 --> 11:52.040
I feel bad about that.

11:52.040 --> 11:54.180
Ever since the old man collapsed,

11:54.180 --> 11:57.870
everyone out to succeed him
has started rubbing each other out.

12:01.880 --> 12:06.990
It's going to take some time for
this infighting to sort itself out.

12:06.990 --> 12:11.590
If he could at least last
until there's a successor...

12:11.590 --> 12:16.160
Otherwise, this town that he's loved will be...

12:16.160 --> 12:19.030
Loved?

12:19.030 --> 12:21.000
Please.

12:21.000 --> 12:23.370
I told you I couldn't do it.

12:26.410 --> 12:28.240
I see.

12:35.380 --> 12:38.850
I'm not letting you leave
until you've treated him.

12:38.850 --> 12:42.020
If you're going to insist that you can't do it,

12:42.020 --> 12:46.190
you'll just have to die.
That's all, Miss Bounty.

12:53.870 --> 12:56.270
She's nowhere to be found?

12:56.270 --> 12:58.210
What do you mean, she's nowhere?

12:58.210 --> 13:01.710
I looked for her everywhere in
the hospital, but she's not here.

13:01.710 --> 13:03.570
Ellis...

13:10.550 --> 13:12.590
A paper airplane?

13:12.590 --> 13:14.920
"The Candela estate."

13:22.300 --> 13:24.820
How do you get to the Candela estate?

13:27.640 --> 13:30.260
Draw me a map. Quickly.

13:52.690 --> 13:54.090
What was that?

13:54.090 --> 13:56.600
Say that again.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.600
Okay!

13:58.600 --> 14:02.840
♪ Taco, taco, tacos! Tasty tacos! ♪

14:02.840 --> 14:07.640
♪ The most awesome tacos are Amigo Tacos! ♪

14:07.640 --> 14:10.140
Teehee!

14:10.140 --> 14:12.310
We get that you're here to deliver tacos.

14:12.310 --> 14:14.820
But why are you dressed like that?

14:14.820 --> 14:20.150
It's customer service! Amigo Tacos!

14:20.150 --> 14:24.160
- Leave.
- This is some kind of mistake.

14:24.160 --> 14:28.460
If a sexier girl comes back here
in that outfit, we'll let her in.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.860
But she has to be sexy.

14:32.470 --> 14:35.300
If you have any last words, say them now.

14:43.480 --> 14:45.250
A beautiful moon.

14:45.250 --> 14:46.910
Yes.

14:48.320 --> 14:51.880
Come over here, Paulina.

14:54.050 --> 14:55.420
Come.

14:55.420 --> 14:57.930
There.

14:57.930 --> 15:02.200
I'm Ellis. Not Paulina.

15:02.200 --> 15:05.700
Sheesh! I'm plenty sexy, damn it!

15:05.700 --> 15:10.400
Owowow... I wonder if
that opened up my wound...

15:13.870 --> 15:15.680
My, my.

15:15.680 --> 15:20.580
Oh, want some tacos? They're tasty. Probably.

15:25.790 --> 15:28.390
These guys hate tacos.

15:28.390 --> 15:31.530
That's too bad.

15:31.530 --> 15:33.430
Your friend's inside.

15:40.530 --> 15:44.240
I see, so Ellis got the bullet out from me.

15:44.240 --> 15:46.710
I couldn't believe my eyes.

15:46.710 --> 15:50.880
But I'm sorry, your request is impossible.

15:50.880 --> 15:55.880
Because I don't think even Ellis
really understands her power.

15:55.880 --> 15:57.420
She doesn't understand it?

15:57.420 --> 16:03.120
Yeah. If she could use it at will,
I'm sure it would be incredible, but...

16:07.460 --> 16:09.400
Ellis!

16:11.730 --> 16:13.400
Impossible, huh?

16:13.400 --> 16:16.670
Nadie, is it okay for you to be up already?

16:16.670 --> 16:20.240
I had no time to think about that,
with you disappearing so suddenly.

16:20.240 --> 16:22.510
I didn't disappear. I'm here.

16:22.510 --> 16:23.840
What?

16:23.840 --> 16:26.180
Yeah, you're right.

16:27.820 --> 16:29.480
How's the old man?

16:29.480 --> 16:33.010
He said... he wanted water.

16:46.630 --> 16:49.500
Let go! I said, let go!

16:49.500 --> 16:52.110
Damn brat! Pulling a stunt like that!

16:52.110 --> 16:55.380
We'll make an example of you!

16:55.380 --> 16:57.370
What's going on here?

16:59.350 --> 17:01.120
Boss...

17:01.120 --> 17:05.020
He tried to steal money from the car!

17:05.020 --> 17:07.620
You did bad things to make
that money anyway, right?!

17:07.620 --> 17:09.850
What was that, you brat?!

17:17.460 --> 17:19.300
Boss?

17:25.010 --> 17:27.370
You want money?

17:35.420 --> 17:37.150
Come with me.

17:37.150 --> 17:39.640
We'll see to your wound.

17:53.430 --> 17:55.670
And that's how you came to be here...

17:55.670 --> 18:01.010
I was never shown any affection,
but I was permitted to stay by his side.

18:01.010 --> 18:02.840
That was enough.

18:02.840 --> 18:07.410
Anywhere you can get
three meals a day is heaven.

18:07.410 --> 18:10.050
Will you be his successor?

18:10.050 --> 18:13.050
No one will follow my lead.

18:13.050 --> 18:17.690
To them, I'm not a member of the Family.

18:17.690 --> 18:22.460
Just a stray dog that wandered
in with an empty stomach.

18:22.460 --> 18:26.070
Thank you, Paulina.

18:26.070 --> 18:27.600
Who's Paulina?

18:27.600 --> 18:29.470
That's his daughter.

18:29.470 --> 18:30.900
Where is she, really?

18:30.900 --> 18:33.440
Dead.

18:33.440 --> 18:35.430
Along with her mother.

18:37.480 --> 18:39.470
They were killed.

18:45.750 --> 18:47.480
Pops!

18:54.160 --> 18:56.560
It seems...

18:56.560 --> 18:59.730
...my time has come...

18:59.730 --> 19:01.720
Don't give up!

19:18.750 --> 19:22.190
It's okay...

19:22.190 --> 19:24.120
...Daddy.

19:31.170 --> 19:33.100
It's okay.

19:40.540 --> 19:43.170
Paulina...

20:08.000 --> 20:10.000
He looks happy.

20:10.000 --> 20:13.470
Thank you, Ellis.

20:13.470 --> 20:17.640
Thanks to you, he got to be
with his family in the end.

20:26.590 --> 20:28.660
This is...

20:28.660 --> 20:30.520
Ellis?

20:32.330 --> 20:33.990
It's the same.

20:33.990 --> 20:36.050
So he still had it...

20:42.540 --> 20:45.670
Back when I was a kid...

20:45.670 --> 20:49.540
I got it for the old man's birthday.

20:49.540 --> 20:52.780
He didn't seem happy with it at all,

20:52.780 --> 20:55.340
so I figured that he'd
thrown it away soon after.

20:57.520 --> 21:01.580
You were... family, too.

21:42.230 --> 21:44.800
He could've just been honest
and said he cared about him...

21:44.800 --> 21:47.930
Maybe it's complicated in a world like theirs...

21:47.930 --> 21:50.740
- I lied.
- Huh?

21:50.740 --> 21:52.760
Even though it's a bad thing...

21:54.310 --> 21:56.740
Ellis, when it comes to lies,

21:56.740 --> 22:00.110
there are good lies and bad lies.

22:00.110 --> 22:03.480
That was a good lie.

22:03.480 --> 22:05.420
A good lie?

22:05.420 --> 22:08.860
Yup, a good lie.

22:08.860 --> 22:12.460
A good... lie...

22:12.460 --> 22:15.330
All right, I think I'll let it rip!

22:15.330 --> 22:18.830
♪ Taco, taco, tacos! Tasty tacos... ♪

22:18.830 --> 22:21.670
- I hate that song.
- Oh, really.

22:24.300 --> 22:29.040
Several days later,
Sanchez vanished from the town.

22:29.040 --> 22:33.270
His whereabouts since then are unknown.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.890
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.890 --> 22:47.790
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.790 --> 22:55.960
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.210 --> 23:05.710
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.710 --> 23:11.490
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.490 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.560
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.560 --> 23:23.560
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.560 --> 23:27.500
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.500 --> 23:34.010
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:34.010 --> 23:37.940
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.940 --> 23:41.380
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.380 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.790
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.790 --> 23:56.790
Subete yo
